[{"answer":"Hi, come and take a seat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Carl Rogers and I'm one of the doctors here at the Total Health Clinic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/3.mp3"},{"answer":"So I understand this is your first visit to the clinic?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/5.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well I hope you'll be very happy with the service you receive here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So if it's alright with you I'll take a few details to help me give you the best possible service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So can I check first of all that we have the correct personal details for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So your full name is Julie Anne Garcia?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/10.mp3"},{"answer":"That's correct.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect. And can I have a contact phone number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 2194429785.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/13.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, and then can I just check that we have the correct date of birth?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/14.mp3"},{"answer":"October 10th, 1992.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I actually have 1991,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just correct that now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so that's all good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I just need a few more personal details...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/19.mp3"},{"answer":"do you have an occupation, either full-time or part-time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I work full-time in Esterhazy's -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/21.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, the restaurant chain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I started off as a waitress there a few years ago and I'm a manager now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh I know them, yeah, they're down on 114th Street, aren't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I've been there a few times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I just love their salads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good to hear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so one more thing I need to know before we talk about why you're here, Julie,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's the name of your insurance company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/30.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Cawley Life Insurance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/31.mp3"},{"answer":"that's CAWLEY.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent, thank you so much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Now Julie, let's look at how we can help you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/34.mp3"},{"answer":"So tell me a little about what brought you here today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've been getting a pain in my knee, the left one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Not very serious at first, but it's gotten worse,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/37.mp3"},{"answer":"so I thought I ought to see someone about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's certainly the right decision.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So how long have you been aware of this pain?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it just a few days, or is it longer than that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Longer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/42.mp3"},{"answer":"It's been worse for the last couple of days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/43.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's three weeks since I first noticed it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/44.mp3"},{"answer":"It came on quite gradually though, so I kind of ignored it at first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And have you taken any medication yourself, or treated it in any way?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Um.. yeah, I've been taking medication to deal with the pain... Tylenol","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and that works OK for a few hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/48.mp3"},{"answer":"But I don't like to keep taking it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/49.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And what about heat treatment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you tried applying heat at all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/51.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but I have been using ice on it for the last few days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And does that seem to help the pain at all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/53.mp3"},{"answer":"A little, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Now you look as if you're quite fit normally?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I am, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/57.mp3"},{"answer":"So do you do any sport on a regular basis?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I play a lot of tennis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I belong to a club so I go there a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm quite competitive so I enjoy that side of it as well as the exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/61.mp3"},{"answer":"But I haven't gone since this started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you do any other types of exercise?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I sometimes do a little swimming,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/65.mp3"},{"answer":"but usually just when I'm on vacation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But normally I go running a few times a week, maybe three or four times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. So your legs are getting quite a pounding.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/68.mp3"},{"answer":"But you haven't had any problems up to now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/69.mp3"},{"answer":"No, not with my legs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I did have an accident last year when I slipped and hurt my shoulder,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/71.mp3"},{"answer":"but that's better now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/73.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you have any allergies?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/74.mp3"},{"answer":"No, none that I'm aware of.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/75.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you take any medication on a regular basis?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I take vitamins but that's all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm generally very healthy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/78.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well let's have a closer look and see what might be causing this problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/79.mp3"},{"answer":"If you can just get up...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-2-part-1-2023-01-29-21-15-54/80.mp3"}]
